        "7d88a6700e3f38156881": "Here you go.  And when you give this pie to that Billy, you tell him I hope he chokes on it!",
        "c01497789ffceda52e96": "Ugh... I'm starving!  Do you have that pie for me, $N?",
        "e46f35ae12d6eed2e6d1": "Mm, yum!  This pie is the best!$B$BI think my memory is coming back to me..."
      },
